WEBVTT

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.976
by state, beginning in '85,
'86, '87 -- these are

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.976
from the CDC website --
'88, '89, '90, '91 -- you

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.976
get a new category --
'92, '93, '94, '95, '96,

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.976
'97, '98, '99, 2000, 2001
-- it gets worse. We're

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.381
kind of devolving. (Laughter)

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.976
Now what can we do about this?
Well, you know, the

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:24.976
diet that we've found
that can reverse heart

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.976
disease and cancer is an Asian diet.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.976
But the people in Asia
are starting to eat like we

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:29.976
are, which is why they're
starting to get sick

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.976
like we are.